{
    "title": "Hobnob - Invitation Card Maker",
    "description": "\ud83c\udf89 Create Stunning Invitations in Seconds for FREE with Hobnob - Invitation Card Maker! \ud83d\udc8c\r\n\r\nAre you searching for the perfect Invitation Card Maker for your event ... Hobnob is your one-stop app for crafting and delivering beautiful, personalized invites. Whether it's a Birthday Party, Baby Shower, Wedding, Graduation Party, or any event you can think of, Hobnob has the perfect template. Make truly unique invitations tailored to your event in seconds with our professionally designed event templates for free. Custom background images and videos, fonts, colors, text element positioning automatically adjusts to your event details saving you a ton of time.\r\n\r\nTOP 3 REASONS TO CHOOSE HOBONB\r\n\r\n1) No design skills required, but your guests will think a professional designer created your invitations\r\n2) Hobnob will save you hours of work making your invitation and hosting your event \r\n3) No app download required for event guests ever\r\n\r\nGOOGLE AWARDS & MENTIONS\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfc6 Google - Wedding Essentials\r\n\ud83c\udfc6 Google - Congrats on Your Engagement!\r\n\r\nFEATURES\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcc5 Hobnob will deliver your invitations digitally, track guest RSVP, and maximize your event attendance\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc8c Share your invitations via text, email, or social media.\r\n\r\n\ud83e\udd16 Let Hobnob handle the busy work of hosting an event for you:\r\n\r\n  - After you make your invitation, hit send and immediately start seeing guest RSVP responses\r\n  - Invites will be sent to your guests via text message or email \r\n  - Guests RSVP immediately via the custom web site Hobnob creates for your event, no app download required\r\n  - Automatic RSVP reminders ensure your guests RSVP\r\n  - And a day before the event, guests will get a reminder with event directions\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf88 EVENT TYPES AND USES FOR HOBNOB\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf82 Birthday Party Invitation Maker\r\n\ud83c\udf82 1st Birthday Party Invitation Maker \r\n\ud83d\udc6d Wedding Invitations Card Maker\r\n\ud83c\udf93 Graduation Party Invitation Card Maker\r\n\ud83d\udc76 Baby Shower Party Invitation Maker\r\n\ud83d\udc6d Bridal Shower Invitations\r\n\ud83c\udf80 Bachelorette Party Invitations\r\n\ud83d\udc6d Bachelor Party Invitations\r\n\ud83c\udf54 BBQ Invitation Maker\r\n\ud83d\udc8d Anniversary Party Invitation Card Maker\r\n\ud83d\udcc8 Company Event Invitations\r\n\ud83d\udc8d Save The Date Card Maker\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf88 HOLIDAY EVENTS\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc07 Easter Party Invitations Maker\r\n\ud83e\udd83 Thanksgiving Invitation Maker\r\n\ud83c\udf83 Halloween Party Invitations Maker\r\n\ud83c\udf84 Christmas Party Invitation Maker\r\n\r\nHobnob is THE invitation card maker you\u2019ve been looking for! Do stuff in real life with Hobnob!\r\n\r\nHobnob Terms of Use: https://hobnob.io/terms\r\nHobnob Privacy Policy: https://hobnob.io/privacy",
